OL,5,G2330 Taggart
OL,6,     FA drugs-related murder on the
OL,7,     Flocal housing scheme proves
OL,8,     Fchallenging for the investigative
OL,9,     Fskills of the Taggart team, as no
OL,10,     Fone seems willing to talk to the
OL,11,     Fpolice.
OL,12,G0135 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FLeila conducts a search and finds
OL,14,     Fsome worrying objects, and
OL,15,     Fterrorists put Miss Davidson's
OL,16,     Flife in danger...
OL,17,G0240 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,18,     FFollowing the shooting, most of
OL,19,     Fthe terrorists are gunned down -
OL,20,     Fbut not all. Jim takes charge at
OL,21,     FWentworth, and Meg is threatened
OL,22,     Fby Geoff.
